   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Write the inequality shown by the shaded region in the graph with the boundary line <span data-math=\"\\;x + y = 5\">\\;x + y = 5</span>.\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/1c801e958766d6d7.png\" alt=\"A line is plotted on an x y coordinate plane. The x and y axes range from negative 10 to 10, in increments of 2.5. The line passes through the points, (negative 5, 10), (0, 5), (5, 0), and (10, negative 5). The region above the line is shaded. Note: all values are approximate.\">\n",
